# Generated artifacts are not hand-formatted code.
#
# pnpm emits its lockfile with single-quoted YAML scalars, while Prettier's
# YAML printer always uses double quotes. The two can never agree, so the
# lockfile is excluded rather than reformatted (~2,900 lines of churn on a
# generated file, with no review value).
pnpm-lock.yaml

